<title>INDIA: India forex market inactive as banks close books.</title>
<headline>India forex market inactive as banks close books.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian forex market was closed on Monday on account of half-yearly closing of bank accounts.</p>
<p>The Indian rupee ended Friday at 35.68/70 per dollar.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
